n of the vertical line in the $xy$-plane that passes through the point $(7,4)$ is\n\n{{field-1}}\n$=$\n{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Since the vertical line should pass through $(7,4)$, the $x$-value for every point on the line is $7.$ Hence, the equation of that line is \n\n$$\nx=7.\n$$\n\n![](images/0f/0f3e14c92e8e31beb12a2e33aa06fa1b9d349fab4688c39a45d4039859f18271.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186490265 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054669 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bf635847-145c-5da5-927e-8196e809324e" :knowledge-point/title "Points Associated With Horizontal and Vertical Lines"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b83ea7a-7427-5328-ba07-11fb3545b16e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-1$, $y=4$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489539} {:answer/id #uuid "d095737e-6521-55d3-a8e6-bb35da8ccbde" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=1$, $y=4$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489977} {:answer/id #uuid "e3e616a6-03c2-550d-bf2c-e11dc888fd14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=1$, $y=-4$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490009} {:answer/id #uuid "e9f46ae0-be31-589f-943a-84782d3ee639" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=4$, $y=1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490022} {:answer/id #uuid "fd4a7f28-4e44-53ab-85e3-a4f8034dc5e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-4$, $y=1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490067}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d095737e-6521-55d3-a8e6-bb35da8ccbde" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=1$, $y=4$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489977} :answer-field/id #uuid "50ef4e91-7804-5a4a-b126-9e76f4a526f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490123}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "72f1e9f4-dfe2-5157-9a7e-252993718bb0" :question/math-academy-id "q-44453" :question/problem "A horizontal line and a vertical line meet at the point $(1,4).$ What are the equations of the vertical and horizontal lines, respectively?" :question/worked-solution "Since the vertical line should pass through $(1,4)$, the $x$-value for every point on the line is $1.$ Hence, the equation of that line is $x=1.$\n\nSince the horizontal line should pass through $(1,4)$, the $y$-value for every point on the line is $4.$ Hence, the equation of that line is $y=4.$\n\n![](images/16/16e33da178489ccfc16b3e4cef5632d95df18b50ece5ae859f666120827da929.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055423 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054666 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b57ffad1-b83f-5ebb-b0fe-928566ffe8b6" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Equation of a Horizontal Line"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4639a0af-b58e-5451-b046-e915e9096b94" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489676} {:answer/id #uuid "62490834-9f0c-5572-88ca-ad788e0caef7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-2x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489745} {:answer/id #uuid "64c9f5e7-f288-521b-ac8c-e112abb68064" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=x-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186489751} {:answer/id #uuid "ed24f543-16c2-5aa9-8031-c4871da99354" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186490026} {:answer/id #uuid "f47907d2-d15b-5c25-b280-3350099fde94" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-2" :db/id #e